      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i used to be is just... gone. like i look at my old posts and my old videos and it's like looking at a stranger. the person everyone actually liked, the person who mattered, that version of me is just dead. now i'm just walking around this shell of a person and it feels so exhausting to keep pretending i'm still here.",
